<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  CBR010 Inspections - Blank Report, generated from a layout spec: a blank routine inspection form
  per structure. Legacy's sections, labels and hand-filled tables
  (cbr-legacy jasper-server .../CBR010_InspectionsBlank.rpt_jrxml and its nine subreports), laid
  out as one band per kind of line, printed by KIND. The lines come in order from
  InspectionsBlankRows, the questions from the inspection form's own selection.
  Where it differs from legacy's layout:
  - Each structure starts a page and numbers its own pages; legacy's extra page break in the PEng
    section left the next structure's first page headed with the last one's numbers.
  - Each section is kept together on a page where it fits.
  - A question's answers print as one spaced line, every one of them, where legacy had five
    12-point slots that clipped "N/A" and could not show a 0-3 scale.
  - The criteria line prints, and the Report Id reads CBR010, not CBR10.
  The ministry line is P_MINISTRY, the logo P_LOGO, and Date Printed P_DATE_PRINTED.
-->
